# What NOT to upload to Vercel.
#
# This file *replaces* .gitignore for deploys rather than adding to it, so
# everything the build needs must survive the list below — src, prisma, public,
# package.json, the lockfile and the configs all do.
#
# Without it the CLI tried to upload 888 MB and was rejected: Turbopack's local
# caches hold single .sst files of 200 MB+, and the hard limit is 100 MB per
# file. None of it is wanted anyway — Vercel installs dependencies and builds
# from source on its own machines.

node_modules
.next
.next-dev
.git

# Local-only: the seeded uploads directory, macOS sidecars, editor noise.
public/uploads/*
!public/uploads/.gitkeep
._*
.DS_Store

# Not part of the running app.
GlobeTrotter.pdf
